<title>HUNGARY: BASKETBALL-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the women's European basketball championship final round on Sunday:</p>
<p>Play-off for third place</p>
<p>Germany beat Hungary 86-61 (halftime 42-29)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Germany - Marlise Askamp 18, Heike Roth 11, Andrea Hohl 10</p>
<p>Hungary - Judit Balogh 12, Andrea Karolyi 10</p>
